{"base":"f7a4921ae7da4a033284005220f349b33fe240c8","description":"Add testing instructions for the release pipeline\n\n\nSwitch release upload from S3 to scp\n\n- scp binaries to files.radicle.dev under per-version dirs\n  so historical releases are preserved automatically and a single\n  public HTTP mount serves everything\n- drop hardcoded version pin in install.sh; fetch /latest at runtime\n  so bumping a release is one action (Cargo.toml + make upload) with\n  no second place to edit\n- upload the `latest` pointer last so it never advertises a version\n  whose binaries aren't yet on disk\n- fail make upload early if any of the four binaries are missing\n  instead of silently publishing a partial release","oid":"1b9d0385280ed9e2c010067a4aa7271607a92e8c","type":"revision"}